st  the sight of his face had made a little  girl cry  and so shoji decided to always cover his  face so that it never causes sadness to  anyone else  as a result we still have no idea what  shoji actually looks like beneath his  mask  this in itself is pretty sad shoji feels  like he has to cover his face for the  sake of others  but the fact that he is willing to do  this in the first place also speaks to  the kind of person that he is  despite his intimidating appearance  shoji  is actually a very kind and  compassionate person  next up is the rock star of class 1a kyo  kajiro who sits in seat number 12.  hailing from shizuoka prefecture kyoka  comes from a family of musicians  and she grew up with music as an  important part of her life  she can sing and play multiple  instruments and her parents were hoping  that kyouka would become a musician like  them but even though kyouka loves  music her dream was to become a hero so  that she could dedicate her life to  helping  other people ultimately kyouka's parents  supported her decision to choose her own  path and become a hero  rather than a musician then we have flex  tape spider-man himself  han tasero who sits in seat number 13.  cerro was born in tokyo and he is a very  friendly and social guy  although he is not as forward about it  as minata and kaminari  sero definitely has a strong interest in  the ladies  and in general he is a fun guy to be  around  although we don't know much about his  background we do know that horikoshi  came up with the idea for his  quirk while shopping in a convenience  store and horikoshi has also stated that  serosquirk  is one of his personal favorites in seat  number 14  we have the one and only chicken of  darkness fumikage  tokoyami comes from shizuoka prefecture  and he is a very quiet reserved and  independent guy  tokoyami has an affinity for darkness  and he is often jokingly referred to as  an  emo by the mha fanbase because of his  fashion sense and his  taste in room 