ernet alone  in his room in the dark if you know what  i mean despite being quite intelligent  mineta keeps coming up with stupid pervy  schemes like trying to peek on the girls  in the public bath  but whenever he tries something like  this he ends up getting wrecked and  suffering some serious consequences  i can't help but think that he has a lot  of potential as long as he starts  putting more focus on being a hero  and less focus on perving out minita  really wants to be popular  and loved so he should do his best to  achieve that goal through heroics  and not through trying to unsuccessfully  create his own harem personally  i think it would be hilarious if minata  one day found a girlfriend that was an  even bigger perv than him  come on horikoshi let's make it happen  and finally  we have the undisputed best girl in  class 1a  momo yaoyarozu who sits in seed number  20.  oh and if you disagree with my accurate  opinion that momo is best girl  feel free to rant about it down in the  comments engagement helps this video  anyway momo was born in aichi prefecture  into a very wealthy family the  yaoyarozus are a famous and prominent  hero family with powerful quirks  and momo's quirk creation is no  exception momo  obviously had a very privileged  upbringing due to her family's wealth  but being rich did not make her arrogant  or lazy  momo works extremely hard she is an  excellent student  and she is an expert strategist she puts  a lot of effort  into learning to use her quirk in the  most effective way  and she also puts incredible amounts of  thought into her plans  and strategies momo is also humble  friendly  and all-around best girl material  and that is it all 20 class 1a students  and their backstories explained if you  enjoyed  this video and you want to see more  bocano here content please leave that  like  it means a lot and if you're new to  anime pro or maybe you watch our videos  but you haven't subscribed yet  make this the video that you subscri